{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：16:36 2026-08-28 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今季蘇偉賢搬了新倉，新馬房環境寬敞，馬匹操練設施有所提升。蘇偉賢今午舉行季前馬房拜神儀式，練者對於新倉環境感到十分滿意，他希望來季能交出更佳的成績。</p>\n<p>今日蘇偉賢於新馬房內舉行季前拜神儀式，有不少馬主出席沙田拜神儀式，包括「運來」系馬主曾炳威、「新力」系馬主黄良柏太太和女兒黄鑀瀅、「彪形」系劉燊濤與劉燊霆、「喜尊龍」杜偉強、「臻至辰」蔡睿徽及「精明勁駿」黃少華等，場面熱鬧。</p>\n<p>騎師方面有梁家俊、楊明綸、鍾易禮、田泰安、巫顯東、霍宏聲、奥爾民、黃智弘及金誠剛等撐場。</p>\n<p>蘇偉賢表示會繼續努力，日後替馬主們爭取多些頭馬。至於開鑼日參戰馬方面，蘇偉賢透露有意安排「上市魅力」及「昇瀧駒」報名。</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img alt=\"奥爾民和「彪形」系馬主劉氏兄弟\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/69222245c1ed29000fa8feff28f058dd/2026-08/99a2470b-cb54-4101-a903-cac1bf0c8556.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cb09e7829fb824804c955f5b12bfe276/2026-08/2fa000f1-a1eb-420c-98c6-ef89c363d053.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"左起：馬主曾炳威、黃智弘及徐玲玲\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5171df1e30c994d84a93bb91f0a6bd33/2026-08/3b5fd73d-d513-4356-a3bf-8682b112f64f.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇偉賢和太太，中間是「新力」系馬主黃鑀瀅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9ac439c306e6839551f6d42192c7b026/2026-08/04d1bc09-baff-46f2-91ad-1a49837656f7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"騎師大合照\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ecda7b4f48a13780f2cf763c71892de8/2026-08/8c71d305-3700-41c9-987b-1a639c6477b9.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d39a3a4234b1a85e43a21314fee93cbf/2026-08/9cc0b58d-eadd-450a-b72c-9d460bf94cc6.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/44414b8b0b0cd2fe274b5c9773e48cf2/2026-08/44eaa113-ed79-4d8e-944a-c5e50636a474.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/14741dd63d4cf01ddcfa427933fd550a/2026-08/81b85ad2-4a77-4a77-a37d-6f40423fa3f4.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/02546bf0f108a1308058ceeae6703270/2026-08/556cc6f7-10c8-4378-968d-74d83515213e.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/df4a0bee8b3504085c8fb5df8433bc89/2026-08/872d7417-2d02-4442-8db1-65682908d21e.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7a145f335d6d3f1ec14116580225fb81/2026-08/886c1a86-c69f-4552-b683-1751fc4800ea.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5af19e3f98ecfe961535098221bccb06/2026-08/1603c642-e7be-43a0-a87b-bac7d8422051.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇偉賢從化馬房同日拜神。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a23d732f38654f6457ec6f1183f0ff91/2026-08/5852fbd7-d1fd-444f-83f7-914618826fe3.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/362c55c8dd0aed345ea4029538bebc17/2026-08/40922c40-03e0-40e3-9d1a-968d9f5c283a.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇偉賢太太及仔女\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d6eedf64a670c824afdf0c1cfb8ccf27/2026-08/52251c95-d75e-43cc-8583-d71d41ce4277.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/48a4bcfe7f560e1bdec75200d3807106/2026-08/534580e4-57cd-4a20-8879-104e98882d07.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/49e8a0560bf39f7f22c0002c13ccabf1/2026-08/2201583e-d3e2-46cf-ada8-90b733bf0168.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3b220ca37142f76e5c942bae7e254423/2026-08/56841997-8b17-4f52-9f2f-3e47a5c6cc7e.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5d51d5a06c858c3bd79868aae8d1778d/2026-08/ad282f1b-66fb-4542-b78f-14bfb09016bf_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/494ae0987f2d70c472e366a8c79e06c8/2026-08/c90af59c-3a1c-4469-9635-ef27404c581d.jpg\"/>\n<p>陳嘉甜</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T09:01:30.882102+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":20,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}